Accordingly, I pass the following:-
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 27.12.2022 passed in MVC.No.6423/2018 by Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Court of Small Causes, Bengaluru (SCCH-24) is modified;
iii) The appellants/claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.8,65,000/- along with interest at 6% per annum as against Rs.3,97,500/-;

